    <unit id="PageDescription">
      <segment>
        <source>Mentions provides trigger-based candidate popups, async option loading, custom trigger tokens, input variants, placement, status and auto-size scenarios.</source>
        <target state="translated">Mentions 提供基於觸發符的候選彈窗、異步選項加載、自定義觸發符、輸入變體、彈出位置、狀態和自動高度場景。</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
